#!/bin/bash
# SessionStart hook: remind agent to use design skills for any UI/design work
# in this project. Fires on startup/resume/clear/compact.
cat << 'REMINDER'
CRITICAL - Design/UI Work Protocol (finance_app / aurora):
For ANY design or UI task (new screens, components, redesigns, colors,
layout, charts, accessibility, styling) ALWAYS invoke, before writing code:
1. Skill "impeccable" - frontend design critique/build guidance for this repo.
2. Skill "ui-ux-pro-max" - UI/UX pattern library (styles, palettes, charts).
Do this even mid-task, not just at the start of a design request - don't
default back to freehand Compose/UI code without checking these skills first.
REMINDER
